      <li><b>Autotiling</b>: look at the neighbours, build a bitmask (N=1, E=2, S=4, W=8 → 16 combos). Adding the 4 diagonals gives 256 combos, but a diagonal
        only matters when both adjacent sides are filled, which collapses them to <b>47</b> unique tiles (the “blob” tileset). Our 47 tiles are built from 4 quarter-tiles each.</li>
